    Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
    Changes: a paint-only shell was extracted from the full model and the mesh
             was scaled and re-oriented to the brief's 4800 x 1900 x 1600 mm.
    The shipped STLs (car_xr_sedan_4800x1900x1600.stl, car_paint_only_4800x1900x1600.stl)
    are modified versions of this model and remain under CC BY 4.0 with
    attribution to mk2design.  See CREDITS.md.

RoboDK robot / tool library models (UR10, the Lucas RC3-1Y1R gantry, the
